                                "sense_id": "0019cdd4-1732-3232-a5bc-f9f432058172",
                                "text": "[O]ne who had heard without seeing the application, would have mistaken the sound for that of a salt-box, in the hand of a dext'rous Merry Andrew, belonging to one of the booths at Bartholomew Fair."
                            }
